  <section class="content-section">
    <h2 id="ctos-description">Description of Service</h2>
    <p>
      The Company userscript runs on Torn.com via a userscript manager (such as Tampermonkey) or Torn PDA. It shows
      company directors how their company is doing: income, customers, staff, stock and trends over time, a
      comparison with companies of the same type and star rating, and suggestions to improve. The data is read
      and stored by the TornManager server; the userscript itself talks only to tornmanager.com. It requires an
      active TornManager subscription.
    </p>
    <p>By installing and using the Company userscript, you agree to:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Allow the userscript to display its interface on Torn.com pages in your browser</li>
      <li>Allow the userscript to communicate with tornmanager.com for sign in, subscription checks and company data</li>
      <li>Allow the TornManager server to store your key and use it to read your own company from the official Torn API every day</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section">
    <h2 id="ctos-api-key">API Key &amp; Authentication</h2>
    <p>
      <strong>Never share your Torn password with anyone, including me.</strong> The Company userscript needs a
      Torn API key with Limited access, because Torn only shares company details such as wages, stock and
      employee effectiveness with Limited keys. Full access keys are refused. Only company directors can sign in.
    </p>
    <p>
      You are responsible for creating and managing your key, checking its usage in your Torn key log, and
      revoking or regenerating it if you suspect misuse. By signing in you allow TornManager to store your key,
      encrypted, and to use it only to read your own company, as described in the Privacy Policy. You can remove
      it at any time in the script's settings.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section">
    <h2 id="ctos-advice">Advice</h2>
    <p>
